  "prefLabel": "Dec 202.03 Notice of Hearings",
  "priorExpiration": "2001-03-17",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Dec 202.03 Notice of Hearings.\n\n(a) Upon receipt of the information identified in Dec 202.02, the committee shall hold a meeting at the location established in Dec 203.01 and with the proper notice as required by RSA 162-F:21 and Dec 204.02.\n\n(b) In a contested case, the committee shall afford an opportunity for an adjudicative proceeding after notice.\n\n(c) The notice required by (a) above shall include:\n\n(1) A statement of the time, place and nature of the hearing;\n\n(2) A statement of the legal authority under which the hearing is to be held;\n\n(3) A reference to the particular sections of the statutes and rules involved;\n\n(4) A short and plain statement of the issues involved; and\n\n(5) That each party has the right to have an attorney present.\n\nSource. #4235, eff 2-20-87, EXPIRED: 2-20-93\n\nNew. #5700, INTERIM, eff 9-17-93, EXPIRED: 1-15-94\n\nNew. #5824, eff 8-30-94, EXPIRED: 8-30-00\n\nNew. #7366, INTERIM, eff 9-18-00, EXPIRED: 3-17-01\n\nNew. #9144-A eff 4-25-08",
